## 💱 8. PBPE‑Biosecurity Value Formula

PBPE‑Dashboard computes:

```
PBPE Value = 
    Disease Loss Reduction (USD)
  + Cost Reduction (USD)
  + Yield Gain (USD)
  + Quality Premium (USD)
  + Food Loss Reduction (USD)
  + Climate Credits (USD)
```

This is the **economic core** of PBPE.

